E AX3005 250-non-exhaustive-match.ax:9:10-13 non-exhaustive-match "non-exhaustive pattern match: missing Green, Blue" #"this `match` does not cover: Green, Blue" ?11:3:"add the missing arms, each a `todo` until it is written"~>"\n    ((Green _) (todo \"Green\"))\n    ((Blue) (todo \"Blue\"))" ?1:1:"import `todo` from IO"~>"(import IO (todo))\n"
